### ============================================================================
### ROTAS ADMIN - Gerenciamento de Usuários (RF14)
### ============================================================================

### Listar Todos os Usuários
GET {{baseUrl}}/admin/usuarios
Accept: application/json

###

### Criar Novo Usuário
POST {{baseUrl}}/admin/usuarios
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
    "nome": "Novo Usuário",
    "email": "novo@ifba.edu.br",
    "matricula": "20261234567",
    "password": "senha123",
    "tipo": "estudante",
    "turno": "matutino"
}

###

### Listar Apenas Bolsistas
GET {{baseUrl}}/admin/usuarios/bolsistas
Accept: application/json

###

### Buscar por Matrícula
GET {{baseUrl}}/admin/usuarios/matricula/20261234567
Accept: application/json

###

### Ver Usuário por ID
GET {{baseUrl}}/admin/usuarios/1
Accept: application/json

###

### Atualizar Usuário
PUT {{baseUrl}}/admin/usuarios/1
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
    "nome": "Nome Atualizado",
    "email": "atualizado@ifba.edu.br"
}

###

### Desativar Usuário
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/admin/usuarios/1
Accept: application/json

###

### Reativar Usuário
POST {{baseUrl}}/admin/usuarios/1/reativar
Accept: application/json
